{"id":"5D","title":"Marital Adultery","part":{"n":5,"title":"Marriage and Divorce"},"url":"/law/05-marriage-and-divorce/5d","entries":[{"id":"5D.1","text":"To lie carnally with another man's wife is forbidden.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":18,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":20,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":22,"verses":"22"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":19,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":10,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":18,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"9"},{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":6,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"19"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:14; Lev. 18:20; Lev. 20:10; Deut 5:18; Deut 22:22; Matt. 5:27; Matt. 19:18; Mark 10: 19; Luke 18:20; Rom. 13:9; 1 Cor. 6:9; Gal. 5:19."},{"id":"5D.2","text":"Whosoever divorces his wife and marries another woman commits adultery.","refs":[{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":10,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Luke 16:18; Mark10:11."},{"id":"5D.3","text":"If a woman divorces her husband and marries another man she commits adultery.","refs":[{"book":"Mark","chapter":10,"verses":"12"}],"citation":"Mark 10:12."},{"id":"5D.4","text":"For an engaged woman to have sex with another man is to be considered as adultery.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":22,"verses":"23-24"}],"citation":"Deut. 22:23-24."},{"id":"5D.5","text":"Adultery not to be committed in the heart.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"28"}],"citation":"Matt. 5:28."},{"id":"5D.6","text":"Instances of Adultery. 2 Sam. 11 , etc.;","refs":[{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":3,"verses":""},{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":13,"verses":"27"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":22,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":6,"verses":"18"},{"book":"John","chapter":8,"verses":"3-11"},{"book":"Revelation","chapter":2,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Jer. 3, etc.; Jer. 13:27; Ezek. 22:11; Mark 6:18; John 8:3-11; Rev. 2:22."},{"id":"5D.7","text":"A childless widow is not to marry a stranger, but rather the brother of her dead husband.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":25,"verses":"5"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":22,"verses":"24"}],"citation":"Deut 25:5; Matt. 22:24."},{"id":"5D.8","text":"Marriage of a divorced woman is adultery.","refs":[{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":3,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":5,"verses":"32"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":10,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":16,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":7,"verses":"2-3"}],"citation":"Jer. 3:1; Matt. 5:32; Mark 10: 12; Luke 16:18; Rom. 7:2-3."},{"id":"5D.9","text":"Procedure regarding a jealous husband who believes his wife has been unfaithful and gone astray to defile herself with another man.","refs":[{"book":"Numbers","chapter":5,"verses":"11-31"}],"citation":"Num. 5:11-31."},{"id":"5D.10","text":"God will judge adulterers.","refs":[{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"4"}],"citation":"Heb. 13:4."}]}